# GitHub Analyzer — Frontend Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values.
# .env is already in .gitignore so it won't be committed.
#
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT — Vite security rule:
#     Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into the JS and IS visible
#     in the browser DevTools. NEVER put secrets (tokens, passwords, DB URLs)
#     here. Those belong exclusively in backend/.env.
#
# ── Backend API URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where your Spring Boot backend is running.
# Dev (default):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
#
# Production example (replace with your actual deployed backend URL):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.railway.app/api
